    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nico and the Shadows</strong> is a light-hearted, spooky adventure game where you play as Nico, a teenage boy who has been bestowed the family mansion from Aunt M. Explore the creepy mansion and uncover an alternate world from Nico's perspective as he encounters various ethereal guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/a7dda3b0fbd770dc496c9377048f7329.poster.avif?t=1749147307\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/a7dda3b0fbd770dc496c9377048f7329.webm?t=1749147307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/a7dda3b0fbd770dc496c9377048f7329.mp4?t=1749147307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of friendly ghosts and solve unique puzzles tied to their pasts that are preventing them from moving on. Search different rooms to find Easter eggs linked to each ghost's past and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/b2758dd479bf74f6948c60081f008c60.poster.avif?t=1749147307\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/b2758dd479bf74f6948c60081f008c60.webm?t=1749147307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645770/extras/b2758dd479bf74f6948c60081f008c60.mp4?t=1749147307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard/Mouse with full Gamepad support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appropriate for all age groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of music variety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nico and the shadows invites you to experience a story of overcoming fear, regret and grief as you slowly realize why Aunt M wanted you to come here.</p>",
